<title>GERMANY: Poland must reform welfare system, farm sector - Ifo.</title>
<headline>Poland must reform welfare system, farm sector - Ifo.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland must reform its welfare system and agricultural sector to underpin the progress it has made in reforming its economy in the last five years, Germany's Ifo economic research institute said.</p>
<p>Poland's export sector was showing signs of weakness and high inflation and unemployment were casting shadows over the positive overall picture, Ifo said in a study to be published on Monday.</p>
<p>Economic growth was again likely to be &quot;impressive&quot; this year at 5.5 to six percent, but the pace of privatisations remained too slow, Ifo said.</p>
<p>((-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525))</p>
